bender (0.1.9-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix four privileged actions that crashed with ValueError (Start/Stop Proxy,
    Hidden Processes, DNS Flush) by migrating them to list-form run(use_sudo=True).
  * Add a pytest suite (validators, Steven Black parser) and AST-enforced
    invariants (no run_shell(use_sudo=True); no dynamic run_shell strings).
  * Normalize licensing to GPLv3 and contact to chuck@nordheim.online everywhere.
  * Remove the unused defusedxml dependency.
  * Declare runtime tools (dnsutils, whois, unhide, flatpak, tinyproxy,
    ansiweather) in Recommends; nala in Suggests.
  * Reconcile version sources (pyproject is the source of truth) and remove the
    hardcoded author path from build_release.sh.

