bender (0.1.3-1) unstable; urgency=high

  * Security Hardening (B-01 to B-06)
  * Closed shell injection vectors across all tabs by replacing string interpolation with list-form arguments.
  * Replaced python's builtin XML parser with defusedxml to prevent XXE.
  * Enforced download size guard and timeout limit on network operations.

